                    "message": "Why can't we always just pull this from D-Bus ?\n\n```\n{\n    \"Exposes\": [\n        {\n            \"Hostname\": \"160.80.40.20\",\n            \"Port\": \"80\",\n            \"Name\": \"sat0\",   <--- Why can't this be our prefix \n            \"Type\": \"SatelliteController\",\n            \"AuthType\": \"None\"\n        }\n    ],\n```"
